{"id":"0d3445b68d4cfbdb","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-downward-LS-property.md","title":"Downward Löwenheim-Skolem Property","display":"df-downward-LS-property — Downward Löwenheim-Skolem Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-downward-LS-property","aliases":["57-df-downward-LS-property"],"display":"df-downward-LS-property — Downward Löwenheim-Skolem Property","depends_on":["[[57-df-abstract-logic]]","[[57-df-compactness-property]]","[[57-df-substructure]]","[[57-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-downward-LS-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-downward-LS-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-downward-LS-property — Downward Löwenheim-Skolem Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"337462c47a6e0696\" href=\"?note=337462c47a6e0696\" title=\"57-df-abstract-logic\">57-df-abstract-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"348361ab4be85a8d\" href=\"?note=348361ab4be85a8d\" title=\"57-df-compactness-property\">57-df-compactness-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90dc104b21b5c21e\" href=\"?note=90dc104b21b5c21e\" title=\"57-df-substructure\">57-df-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a7a345348b1a1d3a\" href=\"?note=a7a345348b1a1d3a\" title=\"57-df-cardinal\">57-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\mathcal V,\\models_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal V,\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"348361ab4be85a8d\" href=\"?note=348361ab4be85a8d\" title=\"57-df-compactness-property\">57-df-compactness-property</a> 的明确语义表示。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(S\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(\\vec c)\">\\(S(\\vec c)\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上加入互异新常量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_1,\\ldots,c_n\">\\(c_1,\\ldots,c_n\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\">\\(\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_{\\vec a}\">\\(\\mathfrak A_{\\vec a}\\)</span> 是同载体扩张，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_i^{\\mathfrak A_{\\vec a}}=a_i\">\\(c_i^{\\mathfrak A_{\\vec a}}=a_i\\)</span>，其他符号解释不变。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\preceq_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 用这些有限参数命名的句子定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq\">\\(\\subseteq\\)</span> 是一阶子结构关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a7a345348b1a1d3a\" href=\"?note=a7a345348b1a1d3a\" title=\"57-df-cardinal\">57-df-cardinal</a> 的基数谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\">\\(\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\\)</span> 为载体基数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|S|\">\\(|S|\\)</span> 为总字母表基数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DownLS}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{DownLS}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 是本原子定义的逻辑性质谓词，保留为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DLS}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{DLS}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 的别名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\preceq_{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\subseteq\\mathfrak A\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec b\\in|\\mathfrak B|^n\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathcal L(S(\\vec c))\\;(\\mathfrak B_{\\vec b}\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A_{\\vec b}\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak B\\preceq_{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\subseteq\\mathfrak A\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec b\\in|\\mathfrak B|^n\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathcal L(S(\\vec c))\\;(\\mathfrak B_{\\vec b}\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A_{\\vec b}\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DLS}(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\forall\\kappa\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\land\\max(|S|,\\aleph_0)\\le\\kappa\\le\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak B\\preceq_{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A\\land\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|=\\kappa)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DLS}(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\forall\\kappa\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\land\\max(|S|,\\aleph_0)\\le\\kappa\\le\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\\to\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak B\\preceq_{\\mathcal L}\\mathfrak A\\land\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|=\\kappa)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DownLS}(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DLS}(\\mathcal L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DownLS}(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DLS}(\\mathcal L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原强版本：每个允许的 κ 都有 L-初等子结构，不把它偷偷弱化成仅存在小模型。DownLS 为后续既有调用的别名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"337462c47a6e0696","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-abstract-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-compactness-property","status":"resolved","id":"348361ab4be85a8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-compactness-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"90dc104b21b5c21e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"a7a345348b1a1d3a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-compactness-property","status":"resolved","id":"348361ab4be85a8d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L,\\mathcal V,\\models_{\\mathcal L}$ 取 [[57-df-compactness-property]] 的明确语义表示。对 $S\\in\\mathcal V$ 和 $n\\in\\mathbb N$，$S(\\vec c)$ 在 $S$ 上加入互异新常量 $c_1,\\ldots,c_n$；对 $\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n$，$\\mathfrak A_{\\vec a}$ 是同载体扩张，$c_i^{\\mathfrak A_{\\vec a}}=a_i$，其他符号解释不变。$\\preceq_{\\mathcal L}$ 用这些有限参数命名的句子定义；$\\subseteq$ 是一阶子结构关系。$\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)$ 为 [[57-df-cardinal]] 的基数谓词，$\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|$ 为载体基数，$|S|$ 为总字母表基数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"a7a345348b1a1d3a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L,\\mathcal V,\\models_{\\mathcal L}